# Pairs with NoConcurrentLeafWrites. Without the gate the reparent write and a checkpoint flush race on the row's etag.
MODULE: FlushIgnoresGate
TARGET: NoConcurrentLeafWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an interleaved flush persists without waiting for the persist-write gate
PERTURBS: BeginFlush

--- FIND
    /\ flush = "idle"
    /\ gate = "free"
    /\ ~cleared
--- REPLACE
    /\ flush = "idle"
    \* MUTATION: the persist-write gate is not awaited
    /\ ~cleared
--- END
